B.TS=new A.W("What does GBL send me?","Signals for NQ, ES, YM and RTY futures: an entry, a stop, up to three targets, and updates until the trade is closed. Every signal and every result goes in a permanent record that cannot be edited afterwards.")
B.Uh=new A.W("Do I have to take every signal?","No. GBL does not know your account size, your risk limits or your situation. Signals are information, not personal advice. Decide for yourself what to take and how much to risk.")
B.Ua=new A.W("How does the free trial work?","You get full access for 7 days. When it ends you choose whether to subscribe. If you do nothing, access simply stops.")
B.U6=new A.W("I am not getting alerts","Open Profile > Notifications and check what the app says about your phone. Then check three things on the phone itself: notifications are allowed for GBL, battery saving is not stopping GBL in the background, and on Huawei, Xiaomi, Oppo and similar phones GBL is allowed to start itself and run in the background. The Alerts tab always shows every signal, even if a push was missed.")
B.U9=new A.W("How are results counted?","In R, which means multiples of the amount risked on a trade. A stop-out is -1R. A trade that reaches its first target at twice the risk is +2R. Wins and losses are both counted, from the same permanent record.")
B.TL=new A.W("How do I cancel?","Profile > Billing > Cancel subscription. You keep access until the end of what you have already paid for.")
B.Uf=new A.W("I forgot my password",'On the sign-in screen tap "Forgot password?". We email a 6-digit code to choose a new password. Check your spam folder if it does not arrive.')
B.TQ=new A.W("How do I delete my account?","Profile > Delete account. You will need your password. Your email, devices and alerts are removed. Records the law and our books require are kept without your email.")
B.Ug=new A.W("Is trading futures risky?","Yes. You can lose more than you put in. Past results do not predict future results. Read the Risk Disclosure in Profile before you trade anything.")
